            "text": "你们昨天如果初十初二就就就直接赢了"
          },
          {
            "index": 2573,
            "source_segment_index": 2573,
            "start_ms": 4907880,
            "end_ms": 4908800,
            "text": "你说的是对的"
          },
          {
            "index": 2574,
            "source_segment_index": 2574,
            "start_ms": 4908800,
            "end_ms": 4910120,
            "text": "小半段对"
          },
          {
            "index": 2575,
            "source_segment_index": 2575,
            "start_ms": 4910120,
            "end_ms": 4912980,
            "text": "好给啊"
          },
          {
            "index": 2576,
            "source_segment_index": 2576,
            "start_ms": 4912980,
            "end_ms": 4913880,
            "text": "刀九才能赢"
          },
          {
            "index": 2577,
            "source_segment_index": 2577,
            "start_ms": 4913880,
            "end_ms": 4914640,
            "text": "你刀九才能赢"
          },
          {
            "index": 2578,
            "source_segment_index": 2578,
            "start_ms": 4915150,
            "end_ms": 4917230,
            "text": "给各位当老师们做本结局的复盘"
          },
          {
            "index": 2579,
            "source_segment_index": 2579,
            "start_ms": 4917230,
            "end_ms": 4919059,
            "text": "本局版行为鬼畜之境"
          },
          {
            "index": 2580,
            "source_segment_index": 2580,
            "start_ms": 4919059,
            "end_ms": 4920959,
            "text": "神人之影院家7号女巫"
          },
          {
            "index": 2581,
            "source_segment_index": 2581,
            "start_ms": 4920959,
            "end_ms": 4922059,
            "text": "9号魔术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2582,
            "source_segment_index": 2582,
            "start_ms": 4922059,
            "end_ms": 4923019,
            "text": "2号定序王子"
          },
          {
            "index": 2583,
            "source_segment_index": 2583,
            "start_ms": 4923019,
            "end_ms": 4923779,
            "text": "8号狼人阵营"
          },
          {
            "index": 2584,
            "source_segment_index": 2584,
            "start_ms": 4923779,
            "end_ms": 4924499,
            "text": "6号11号"
          },
          {
            "index": 2585,
            "source_segment_index": 2585,
            "start_ms": 4924499,
            "end_ms": 4925659,
            "text": "12号鬼术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2586,
            "source_segment_index": 2586,
            "start_ms": 4925659,
            "end_ms": 4928240,
            "text": "5号平民阵营一号3号"
          },
          {
            "index": 2587,
            "source_segment_index": 2587,
            "start_ms": 4928240,
            "end_ms": 4928800,
            "text": "4号"
          },
          {
            "index": 2588,
            "source_segment_index": 2588,
            "start_ms": 4928800,
            "end_ms": 4930080,
            "text": "10号首页"
          },
          {
            "index": 2589,
            "source_segment_index": 2589,
            "start_ms": 4930080,
            "end_ms": 4935020,
            "text": "鬼术师交换3号平民及10号平民老鼠呃"
          },
          {
            "index": 2590,
            "source_segment_index": 2590,
            "start_ms": 4935020,
            "end_ms": 4938380,
            "text": "魔术师技能通过狼人击杀4号平民女巫"
          },
          {
            "index": 2591,
            "source_segment_index": 2591,
            "start_ms": 4938380,
            "end_ms": 4939340,
            "text": "要救起形成平安夜"
          },
          {
            "index": 2592,
            "source_segment_index": 2592,
            "start_ms": 4939340,
            "end_ms": 4942550,
            "text": "预言家验证了2号玩家魔术师为好人身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 2593,
            "source_segment_index": 2593,
            "start_ms": 4942550,
            "end_ms": 4943910,
            "text": "在警上竞选环节"
          },
          {
            "index": 2594,
            "source_segment_index": 2594,
            "start_ms": 4943910,
            "end_ms": 4946090,
            "text": "6号狼人选择自爆入夜"
          },
          {
            "index": 2595,
            "source_segment_index": 2595,
            "start_ms": 4946090,
            "end_ms": 4949510,
            "text": "鬼术师技能通过魔术师交换7号预言家吉"
          },
          {
            "index": 2596,
            "source_segment_index": 2596,
            "start_ms": 4949510,
            "end_ms": 4952960,
            "text": "10号平民狼人击杀3号平民女巫"
          },
          {
            "index": 2597,
            "source_segment_index": 2597,
            "start_ms": 4952960,
            "end_ms": 4955040,
            "text": "技能空过预言家验证了4号玩家"
          },
          {
            "index": 2598,
            "source_segment_index": 2598,
            "start_ms": 4955040,
            "end_ms": 4956889,
            "text": "平民为好人身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 2599,
            "source_segment_index": 2599,
            "start_ms": 4956889,
            "end_ms": 4958249,
            "text": "在延期竞选环节"
          },
          {
            "index": 2600,
            "source_segment_index": 2600,
            "start_ms": 4958249,
            "end_ms": 4962089,
            "text": "11号狼人选择自曝本局游戏警徽流失好"
          },
          {
            "index": 2601,
            "source_segment_index": 2601,
            "start_ms": 4962089,
            "end_ms": 4964290,
            "text": "入夜诡术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2602,
            "source_segment_index": 2602,
            "start_ms": 4964290,
            "end_ms": 4968350,
            "text": "交换了5号鬼术师以及8号定序王子"
          },
          {
            "index": 2603,
            "source_segment_index": 2603,
            "start_ms": 4968350,
            "end_ms": 4972220,
            "text": "魔术师技能通过狼人击杀7号预言家"
          },
          {
            "index": 2604,
            "source_segment_index": 2604,
            "start_ms": 4972220,
            "end_ms": 4974020,
            "text": "女巫技能继续通过预言家验证"
          },
          {
            "index": 2605,
            "source_segment_index": 2605,
            "start_ms": 4974020,
            "end_ms": 4976700,
            "text": "5号鬼畜师为好狼人身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 2606,
            "source_segment_index": 2606,
            "start_ms": 4976700,
            "end_ms": 4978600,
            "text": "在第三天的白天"
          },
          {
            "index": 2607,
            "source_segment_index": 2607,
            "start_ms": 4978600,
            "end_ms": 4980620,
            "text": "定序王子发动技能后"
          },
          {
            "index": 2608,
            "source_segment_index": 2608,
            "start_ms": 4980620,
            "end_ms": 4983780,
            "text": "我们最终为10号平民被抗推出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 2609,
            "source_segment_index": 2609,
            "start_ms": 4983780,
            "end_ms": 4985900,
            "text": "入夜鬼术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2610,
            "source_segment_index": 2610,
            "start_ms": 4985900,
            "end_ms": 4990420,
            "text": "交换2号魔术师以及12号狼人魔术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2611,
            "source_segment_index": 2611,
            "start_ms": 4990420,
            "end_ms": 4993410,
            "text": "交换一号平民以及2号魔术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2612,
            "source_segment_index": 2612,
            "start_ms": 4993410,
            "end_ms": 4995890,
            "text": "狼人击杀8号定序王子"
          },
          {
            "index": 2613,
            "source_segment_index": 2613,
            "start_ms": 4995890,
            "end_ms": 4998270,
            "text": "女巫毒杀5号诡术师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2614,
            "source_segment_index": 2614,
            "start_ms": 4998270,
            "end_ms": 4999920,
            "text": "5号八号双子"
          },
          {
            "index": 2615,
            "source_segment_index": 2615,
            "start_ms": 4999920,
            "end_ms": 5001380,
            "text": "在第四天的白天"
          },
          {
            "index": 2616,
            "source_segment_index": 2616,
            "start_ms": 5001380,
            "end_ms": 5003240,
            "text": "一号平民被抗推出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 2617,
            "source_segment_index": 2617,
            "start_ms": 5003240,
            "end_ms": 5008290,
            "text": "入夜魔术师交换了4号平民以及9号女巫狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 2618,
            "source_segment_index": 2618,
            "start_ms": 5008290,
            "end_ms": 5010030,
            "text": "击杀12号狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 2619,
            "source_segment_index": 2619,
            "start_ms": 5010030,
            "end_ms": 5012290,
            "text": "最终12号狼人倒牌游戏结束"
          },
          {
            "index": 2620,
            "source_segment_index": 2620,
            "start_ms": 5012290,
            "end_ms": 5013400,
            "text": "好人阵营获胜"
          },
          {
            "index": 2621,
            "source_segment_index": 2621,
            "start_ms": 5013400,
            "end_ms": 5016040,
            "text": "以上是我们今天第二局鬼书致敬的全部内容"
          },
          {
            "index": 2622,
            "source_segment_index": 2622,
            "start_ms": 5016040,
            "end_ms": 5017680,
            "text": "感谢每一位大木老师的陪伴"
          },
          {
            "index": 2623,
            "source_segment_index": 2623,
            "start_ms": 5017680,
            "end_ms": 5019530,
            "text": "然后也希望各位大众宝生们"
          },
          {
            "index": 2624,
            "source_segment_index": 2624,
            "start_ms": 5019530,
            "end_ms": 5020750,
            "text": "可以来到我们各大应用平台"
          },
          {
            "index": 2625,
            "source_segment_index": 2625,
            "start_ms": 5020750,
            "end_ms": 5022410,
            "text": "搜索一下我们天天狼人app"
          },
          {
            "index": 2626,
            "source_segment_index": 2626,
            "start_ms": 5022410,
            "end_ms": 5023770,
            "text": "可以跟我们一起来玩网杀游戏"
          },
          {
            "index": 2627,
            "source_segment_index": 2627,
            "start_ms": 5023770,
            "end_ms": 5026370,
            "text": "也再次感谢天狼app对我们节目的大力支持"
          },
          {
            "index": 2628,
            "source_segment_index": 2628,
            "start_ms": 5026370,
            "end_ms": 5027299,
            "text": "以及赞助"
          },
          {
            "index": 2629,
            "source_segment_index": 2629,
            "start_ms": 5027299,
            "end_ms": 5029019,
            "text": "同样的各位高校学子们"
          },
          {
            "index": 2630,
            "source_segment_index": 2630,
            "start_ms": 5029019,
            "end_ms": 5030859,
            "text": "记得及时来到我们金融大师赛官博"
          },
          {
            "index": 2631,
            "source_segment_index": 2631,
            "start_ms": 5030859,
            "end_ms": 5033219,
            "text": "查看一下我们本年度的高校联赛"
          },
          {
            "index": 2632,
            "source_segment_index": 2632,
            "start_ms": 5033219,
            "end_ms": 5034499,
            "text": "报名的详细讯息"
          },
          {
            "index": 2633,
            "source_segment_index": 2633,
            "start_ms": 5034499,
            "end_ms": 5037960,
            "text": "我们这次为各位我们最终可能获得冠军的选手"
          },
          {
            "index": 2634,
            "source_segment_index": 2634,
            "start_ms": 5037960,
            "end_ms": 5039600,
            "text": "准备了1万元的奖学金"
          },
          {
            "index": 2635,
            "source_segment_index": 2635,
            "start_ms": 5039600,
            "end_ms": 5042400,
            "text": "同样呢会有一各直通我们金融大师赛的名额"
          },
          {
            "index": 2636,
            "source_segment_index": 2636,
            "start_ms": 5042400,
            "end_ms": 5044240,
            "text": "希望各位能够在下周三"
          },
          {
            "index": 2637,
            "source_segment_index": 2637,
            "start_ms": 5044240,
            "end_ms": 5046930,
            "text": "也就是3月20号之前抓紧时间报名"
          },
          {
            "index": 2638,
            "source_segment_index": 2638,
            "start_ms": 5046930,
            "end_ms": 5049290,
            "text": "接下来请导播老师把镜头移交出第二现场"
          },
          {
            "index": 2639,
            "source_segment_index": 2639,
            "start_ms": 5049290,
            "end_ms": 5051070,
            "text": "请两位解说老师跟我们一起聊聊天"
          },
          {
            "index": 2640,
            "source_segment_index": 2640,
            "start_ms": 5051070,
            "end_ms": 5052370,
            "text": "稍后回来会是第三局"
          },
          {
            "index": 2641,
            "source_segment_index": 2641,
            "start_ms": 5052370,
            "end_ms": 5053370,
            "text": "机械狼通灵师"
          },
          {
            "index": 2642,
            "source_segment_index": 2642,
            "start_ms": 5053370,
            "end_ms": 5054770,
            "text": "一会见"
          },
          {
            "index": 2643,
            "source_segment_index": 2643,
            "start_ms": 5061800,
            "end_ms": 5066240,
            "text": "呃通过正常白天的聊天的传递信息掩盖了"
          },
          {
            "index": 2644,
            "source_segment_index": 2644,
            "start_ms": 5066240,
            "end_ms": 5068400,
            "text": "就是二和九的配合打得非常好"
          },
          {
            "index": 2645,
            "source_segment_index": 2645,
            "start_ms": 5068400,
            "end_ms": 5070400,
            "text": "是的9号说42互换"
          },
          {
            "index": 2646,
            "source_segment_index": 2646,
            "start_ms": 5070400,
            "end_ms": 5072800,
            "text": "然后二诶get到了四九换"
          },
          {
            "index": 2647,
            "source_segment_index": 2647,
            "start_ms": 5072800,
            "end_ms": 5074230,
            "text": "然后狼被骗了"
          },
          {
            "index": 2648,
            "source_segment_index": 2648,
            "start_ms": 5074230,
            "end_ms": 5075150,
            "text": "对对吧"
          },
          {
            "index": 2649,
            "source_segment_index": 2649,
            "start_ms": 5075150,
            "end_ms": 5075950,
            "text": "好人之间"
          },
          {
            "index": 2650,
            "source_segment_index": 2650,
            "start_ms": 5075950,
            "end_ms": 5078600,
            "text": "好人之间达成了这种配置上的默契"
          },
          {
            "index": 2651,
            "source_segment_index": 2651,
            "start_ms": 5078600,
            "end_ms": 5081720,
            "text": "但是狼队没有get到好人是在打配合啊"
          },
          {
            "index": 2652,
            "source_segment_index": 2652,
            "start_ms": 5081720,
            "end_ms": 5085160,
            "text": "以为就2号可能就是啊简单的四十二一互换好"
          },
          {
            "index": 2653,
            "source_segment_index": 2653,
            "start_ms": 5085160,
            "end_ms": 5086880,
            "text": "那我来个自刀或者不自刀啊"
          },
          {
            "index": 2654,
            "source_segment_index": 2654,
            "start_ms": 5086880,
            "end_ms": 5089120,
            "text": "但完全没有想到他外置位去刀"
          },
          {
            "index": 2655,
            "source_segment_index": 2655,
            "start_ms": 5089120,
            "end_ms": 5091140,
            "text": "没有没有考虑到没有考虑到"
          },
          {
            "index": 2656,
            "source_segment_index": 2656,
            "start_ms": 5091140,
            "end_ms": 5093940,
            "text": "那荣耀也只给了一个答案"
          },
          {
            "index": 2657,
            "source_segment_index": 2657,
            "start_ms": 5093940,
            "end_ms": 5095059,
            "text": "42互换"
          },
          {
            "index": 2658,
            "source_segment_index": 2658,
            "start_ms": 5095059,
            "end_ms": 5097419,
            "text": "甚至都没有说你考虑一下有没有自刀的"
          },
          {
            "index": 2659,
            "source_segment_index": 2659,
            "start_ms": 5097419,
            "end_ms": 5099979,
            "text": "可能这个事他荣耀都没有说"
          },
          {
            "index": 2660,
            "source_segment_index": 2660,
            "start_ms": 5099979,
            "end_ms": 5100899,
            "text": "你说荣耀想不到吗"
          },
          {
            "index": 2661,
            "source_segment_index": 2661,
            "start_ms": 5100899,
            "end_ms": 5101619,
            "text": "他一定想得到"
          },
          {
            "index": 2662,
            "source_segment_index": 2662,
            "start_ms": 5101619,
            "end_ms": 5102299,
            "text": "他都没有说"
          },
          {
            "index": 2663,
            "source_segment_index": 2663,
            "start_ms": 5102299,
            "end_ms": 5103559,
            "text": "没有说的原因是什么呢"
          },
          {
            "index": 2664,
            "source_segment_index": 2664,
            "start_ms": 5103559,
            "end_ms": 5104239,
            "text": "对不对"
          },
          {
            "index": 2665,
            "source_segment_index": 2665,
            "start_ms": 5104239,
            "end_ms": 5105840,
            "text": "就是要误导狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 2666,
            "source_segment_index": 2666,
            "start_ms": 5105840,
            "end_ms": 5107800,
            "text": "但是真正的魔术师他考虑的会比较多"
          },
          {
            "index": 2667,
            "source_segment_index": 2667,
            "start_ms": 5107800,
            "end_ms": 5108680,
            "text": "他觉得42换"
          }
        ],
